DARKLIGHT REQUIEM — PUNHOS DA RUÍNA, {SKIN} / {FORM}. Draw exactly EIGHT complete full-body sprites in TWO ROWS OF FOUR. SAME ACTION in EIGHT DIFFERENT DIRECTIONS. Full head/body/gear/effects inside separate regions, generous transparent gaps. TRUE transparent RGBA. No labels/text/grid/floor/cast shadow/checkerboard.
Refs: 1 approved whole-character turnaround gives camera; 2 approved form comparison gives color/costume/crystals; 3 same-skin approved combat sheet gives face/gear/martial motion, NOT a camera to copy into every view; 4 eyes same dark RED#C40814/#5A0000, clean warm skin#F6AE82. Ref5 {REF5}.
IDENTITY: {COSTUME}
FORM: {PALETTE}
Wear TWO blackened-metal forearm/fist gauntlets with silver/bronze fang ridges/crescent knuckles and TWO matching armored shin/boots. No held katana/dagger/scythe/chain. Keep decorative silver hip chain on anatomical left, no mechanical mirroring. Same youthful compact large-head RPG proportions/style, slightly elevated 2D RPG camera. Deliberate square pixel clusters/dark outlines, no blur/painting/adult realism/isometric.
ACTION: {ACTION}
Direction and actual strike path must differ:
row1col1 S FRONT, both eyes, strike toward viewer/down-screen, strongly foreshortened;
row1col2 SW FRONT-LEFT, nose/toes/fist or kicking foot toward IMAGE LOWER LEFT;
row1col3 W TRUE LEFT PROFILE, nose/toes/strike LEFT;
row1col4 NW REAR-LEFT, back hair/garment dominate, strike UPPER LEFT;
row2col1 N TRUE BACK, NO FACE/EYES/FRONTAL SHIRT, strike AWAY/up-screen, foreshortened beyond shoulder, not sideways;
row2col2 NE REAR-RIGHT, back dominates, strike UPPER RIGHT;
row2col3 E TRUE RIGHT PROFILE, nose/toes/strike RIGHT;
row2col4 SE FRONT-RIGHT, nose/toes/strike LOWER RIGHT.
For non-striking actions the same facing grid still applies. Do not copy southeast into S/SW/W. Draw real entire figure orientations, no part collage, flat rotation or mirrored asymmetries. Armor recognizable, aura localized to forearms/fists/shins/feet and contact, face/skin never tinted by aura.
Keep SAME body scale across eight views. Match source-density: at1536x1024 sheet, standing anatomy roughly430px tall, head/hair roughly130px; crouch/jump changes pose, never enlarges head/body to fill cell. Native dimensions/grid must be inspected after generation, not guaranteed by prompt.
